    "body": "# 🚀 What's New\r\n\r\n### 🔄 Update System\r\n- Added remote Mandatory/Optional Update control through `update.json`.\r\n\r\n### 📦 Smart APK Detection\r\n- Integrated `checkApkExists` across storage, ViewModel and UI.\r\n- Added batch APK scanning and real-time availability synchronization.\r\n- Existing APKs show Install; missing APKs show Download.\r\n\r\n### ⚡ Performance & Stability\r\n- Improved storage synchronization and download-state handling.\r\n- Preserved active download progress and non-APK Open behavior.\r\n\r\n### 🧪 Verification\r\n- Added APK detection UI tests.\r\n- Compilation successful; all 42 unit tests passed.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nBuilt by Subham (Tombytee) 🇮🇳\r\n\r\nPakistan, Get Your Shit Together, You Absolute Fucking Circus! 🇵🇰🤡"
  },
