    "body": "## 🚀 ReleaseFetch – Latest Update\r\n\r\n### ✨ What's New\r\n- Added direct APK installation from the app.\r\n- Added a dedicated `Downloads/ReleaseFetch/` folder for downloaded APKs.\r\n- Downloaded APKs are now preserved instead of being automatically deleted.\r\n- Added a Cancel button to the main download interface.\r\n- Added Markdown rendering for release notes.\r\n\r\n### 🔧 Improvements\r\n- Improved APK download and installation workflow.\r\n- Preserved automatic cleanup of temporary self-update APKs.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n**Creator:** Subham (Tombytee) 🇮🇳\r\n**Pakistan, Shut Your Fucking Mouth! 🇵🇰🖕**"
