    "body": "# 🚀 ReleaseFetch v1.0 — First Official Release!\r\n\r\nWelcome to the very first official release of **ReleaseFetch**! 🎉 \r\n\r\nReleaseFetch is designed to make downloading GitHub repository releases effortless. Just drop any repository URL, and the app fetches all releases, automatically highlights the best asset for your device, and lets you download & install it right away.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### ✨ Key Features\r\n* 🔗 **Quick URL Fetching:** Instantly load releases for any public GitHub repository.\r\n* 🎯 **Smart Device Matching:** Automatically detects your architecture and highlights the best-suited APK or asset for your device.\r\n* 📥 **Direct Downloads:** Seamlessly manage downloads right from the app.\r\n* 🔄 **Built-in In-App Update System:** Features an automatic update checker that verifies future versions safely in the background, making sure you stay up to date without annoying interruptions.\r\n* ⚡ **Clean UI:** Built with a modern Material 3 design for a smooth, distraction-free experience.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### 📦 How to Install\r\n1. Download the `app-release.apk` file from the **Assets** section below.\r\n2. Tap on the downloaded file to install it on your Android device. *(If prompted, allow installation from unknown sources in your settings).*\r\n3. Open ReleaseFetch, paste any GitHub repo link, and enjoy!\r\n\r\n---\r\n*Built with ❤️ by Subham Kumar Prusty.*"
